            ("gen_replication", "DNA replication is semi-conservative. Helicase unwinds the double helix and DNA polymerase adds nucleotides in the five-prime to three-prime direction. The leading strand is built continuously while the lagging strand is built as short Okazaki fragments that DNA ligase joins together.", "What are Okazaki fragments?"),
